    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i’m already gone. watching him fade away every single day... it’s like i'm just waiting in a waiting room for a life that's already ended. i'm so tired of the routine, the smell of the meds, the silence. i feel like i'm just haunting my own house.",
